<title>USA: Clothestime Inc Q1 shr falls.</title>
<headline>Clothestime Inc Q1 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Clothestime Inc.</p>
<p>		   Summary Results of Operations (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		   (000's Omitted, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>							Period Ending</p>
<p>					Apr 26, 1997	 Apr 27, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				 $42,482		$43,667</p>
<p> Net Loss				    3,380		  5,852</p>
<p> Loss Per Share			     0.24		   0.41</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	   14,198		 14,198</p>
<p>On Dec. 8, 1995, The Clothestime Stores Inc., and five of its subsidiaries filed for protection under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.</p>
